### CRITICAL — Auth missing on 7 routes (`backend/src/routes/notebookRoutes.ts`)

Routes that must check `X-API-KEY` header but currently don't:

| Route | Line (approx) |
|-------|--------------|
| `GET /notebook/notebooks` | ~61 |
| `GET /notebook/notebooks/:id` | ~69 |
| `GET /sources/:sourceId/status` | ~147 |
| `GET /sources/:sourceId` | ~157 |
| `GET /notebooks/:id/stream` (RAG chat) | ~182 |
| `GET /notebooks/:id/messages` | ~298 |
| `GET /notebooks/:id/viz/*` (4 routes) | ~308-338 |

Fix pattern — reuse the existing `requireApiKey` middleware already used on mutating routes:
```typescript
router.get('/notebook/notebooks', requireApiKey, (req, res) => { ... });
```

